    - proceedType: button
      buttonText: OK!
      posX: 512
      posY: 300
      hasArrow: 0
      arrowX: 0
      arrowY: 0
      arrowDirection: -1
      blockNext: 0
      text: Now try to find the rest of the items by yourself. Good luck!
  - lines:
    - proceedType: button
      buttonText: OK!
      posX: 512
      posY: 300
      hasArrow: 0
      arrowX: 0
      arrowY: 0
      arrowDirection: -1
      blockNext: 0
      text: Different customer has different personalities.
    - proceedType: button
      buttonText: OK!
      posX: 512
      posY: 300
      hasArrow: 0
      arrowX: 0
      arrowY: 0
      arrowDirection: -1
      blockNext: 0
      text: Some are more patient but will tip less, while others may get upset faster
